{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3f23f5ab-eba7-8c29-9e87-0a3455fa2d4d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T11:51:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey Kevin, Stephen Tillinghast here. So, I grew up down by the harbor, right, and my father used to say you could tell the season by what the gutters were doing. Leaves in fall, ice in winter. Well, the gutter by me is doing the leaves thing in February."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, so a gutter, a drain issue. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "373 Old Beach Road, the Easton's Beach side. There's a catch basin right on the corner there, and it's packed solid with leaves. Been like that since the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 373 Old Beach Road, catch basin on the corner, clogged with leaves. And what's it doing, is the water backing up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:47:21-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, there's a big puddle that just sits there. It never drains. And I want to be clear, it hasn't even rained. It's been dry for days. So it's just the same water sitting there, going nowhere, and now it's got a skin of ice on it in the mornings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so no storm, just the standing water from before and the basin's blocked. Is it in the road or up on the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the road edge, but it spreads over to the sidewalk, so people walking to the beach have to go around into the street. My neighbor, the older guy next door, he says it happens every big rain. Every single one. He says he's called before and nothing really changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:48:24-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. I don't have his calls in front of me, but I'll put it in as a request for a crew to clear the basin. Can I get a name for the ticket? I got Stephen, Tillinghast, how do you spell that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:48:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "T-I-L-L-I-N-G-H-A-S-T."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tillinghast, got it. Thanks, Stephen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. And honestly it's frustrating, because it's the same corner every time. Somebody comes out in the spring, scoops it, and then by the next fall it's back to this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:49:08-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that it's a repeat spot, that way the crew knows. Let me read it back. Catch basin on the corner by 373 Old Beach Road, clogged with leaves since the weekend, standing water, no recent rain. That right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Hey, do the crews work weekends? Because if it's going to sit till Monday I'd like to know, with the ice and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly they're out weekdays. Weekends it's usually just emergencies. This isn't an emergency exactly, but I'll flag the ice on the sidewalk and ask them to get to it as early as they can. Could be today, could be early next week, depends on their list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So probably Monday, realistically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. I'd rather not promise you a day. Is there a number I can reach you at if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-seven. Perfect. And the supervisor who handles the drain crew, Mr. Clooney, he'll see this when he comes in from the field."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clooney? Like George Clooney?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sorry, I said Clooney? I meant Looney, L-O-O-N-E-Y. Different guy entirely. Long day, it's almost noon and my tongue's already tied."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, if George Clooney shows up with a rake I'll be more impressed with the service. But yeah, fine. Looney."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll make sure it gets to him. Anything else going on out there, any other drains?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just that one. That's the one that bothers me. I just want it cleared before it freezes solid, because then it's a real mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense. Ticket's in. If it's still sitting there Tuesday, call back and tell them it's the Old Beach Road one and we'll push it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I will. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Stephen. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T11:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
